    "detailed_description": "<h1>Follow Us</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Liquid Meow Lite DISCORD\uff01\uff01\uff01</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399690/extras/77e81013e678342f15a2ccba5451b617.avif?t=1751869932\" width=700 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simple motorcycle racing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, everything is about winning. Grab your weapons and sweep everyone off the road into the trash, or rule with speed and outpace everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Single rider, insane challenges!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399690/extras/4c531fad52d472ec90d69160544f3b21.poster.avif?t=1751869932\" width=700 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399690/extras/4c531fad52d472ec90d69160544f3b21.webm?t=1751869932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399690/extras/4c531fad52d472ec90d69160544f3b21.mp4?t=1751869932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through wildly diverse themed maps as your motorcycle fuels adrenaline and power!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for the top spot\u2014leave rivals in the dust or...  take them down!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins to unlock weapons and motorcycles, and become the coolest rider on the block!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Racing Showdown, Battle with Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399690/extras/007138a08055a059c80238fb6034bb23.poster.avif?t=1751869932\" width=700 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399690/extras/007138a08055a059c80238fb6034bb23.webm?t=1751869932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399690/extras/007138a08055a059c80238fb6034bb23.mp4?t=1751869932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore endless levels, each with a unique style and theme, offering a fresh and thrilling experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive a variety of amazing racing cars to defeat opponents on the track and write your own racing legend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports two players competing in the same arena, challenging each other to see who can stand out and who will be the &quot;lucky&quot; last place.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Vehicles, Abundant Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399690/extras/c3a9a0438aa34fd7cccc0eeb5082e4e4.poster.avif?t=1751869932\" width=700 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399690/extras/c3a9a0438aa34fd7cccc0eeb5082e4e4.webm?t=1751869932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399690/extras/c3a9a0438aa34fd7cccc0eeb5082e4e4.mp4?t=1751869932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399690/extras/0528c998d90466e3346d3ea9d22b8671.poster.avif?t=1751869932\" width=700 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399690/extras/0528c998d90466e3346d3ea9d22b8671.webm?t=1751869932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399690/extras/0528c998d90466e3346d3ea9d22b8671.mp4?t=1751869932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From powerful long-range weapons to agile close-combat tools, and vehicles with varying speeds and endurance, each combination offers a fresh gaming experience waiting for you to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your vehicle and weapons according to your personal preferences, ensuring that every race is a unique and exclusive experience, both in appearance and performance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Freedom, Personalized Racing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399690/extras/29438bb63174d7cbac8981622401ce01.poster.avif?t=1751869932\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399690/extras/29438bb63174d7cbac8981622401ce01.webm?t=1751869932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399690/extras/29438bb63174d7cbac8981622401ce01.mp4?t=1751869932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the futuristic tech vibe of alien skins to the primal strength of lizardman skins, a variety of unique character skins await your unlocking. Each skin comes with its corresponding theme story, adding more vibrancy to your racing journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies in the game will also appear in diverse forms, ensuring that every race is filled with freshness and unpredictability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come on, personalize your racing experience. Whether you're slyly advancing as a streetwise rascal or making a dazzling sprint as an alien, show off your one-of-a-kind style and stand out on the track.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Push the Limits, Conquer the BOSS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399690/extras/15432b41e43d7518e1f9f9a9fe89111d.poster.avif?t=1751869932\" width=700 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399690/extras/15432b41e43d7518e1f9f9a9fe89111d.webm?t=1751869932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399690/extras/15432b41e43d7518e1f9f9a9fe89111d.mp4?t=1751869932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the levels, more themes will be gradually unlocked.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss battle levels await your challenge, with each boss presenting a unique challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The endless number of levels tests your limits, and every challenge offers new possibilities.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399690/extras/77e81013e678342f15a2ccba5451b617.avif?t=1751869932\" width=700 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simple motorcycle racing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, everything is about winning. Grab your weapons and sweep everyone off the road into the trash, or rule with speed and outpace everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Single rider, insane challenges!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399690/extras/4c531fad52d472ec90d69160544f3b21.poster.avif?t=1751869932\" width=700 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399690/extras/4c531fad52d472ec90d69160544f3b21.webm?t=1751869932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399690/extras/4c531fad52d472ec90d69160544f3b21.mp4?t=1751869932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through wildly diverse themed maps as your motorcycle fuels adrenaline and power!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for the top spot\u2014leave rivals in the dust or...  take them down!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins to unlock weapons and motorcycles, and become the coolest rider on the block!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Racing Showdown, Battle with Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399690/extras/007138a08055a05